<title>GREECE: Hard drachma halts Greek July WP import inflation.</title>
<headline>Hard drachma halts Greek July WP import inflation.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's wholesale price index for imported goods was 0.81 percent year-on-year in July down from 0.98 percent in June, figures released by the National Statistics Service (NSS) showed.</p>
<p>The central bank's hard drachma policy accounted largely for the virtual halt, bankers said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
